flowchart TD
 Alert[🚨 Alert or report] --> Triage[Assess scope and impact]
 Triage --> Contain[Contain affected route, credential or service]
 Contain --> Evidence[Preserve evidence safely]
 Evidence --> Rotate[Rotate exposed secrets if needed]
 Rotate --> Recover[Mitigate or restore service]
 Recover --> Verify[Verify access and data integrity]
 Verify --> Notify[Notify affected parties when required]
 Notify --> Learn[Document root cause and prevention]
